---
description: Scope AI context to relevant code and docs
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Prefer files in `src/`, `tests/`, `configs/`, `README.md`, `pyproject.toml`, and `.pre-commit-config.yaml`.
- Avoid loading large data/model artifacts or generated reports into context.
- When editing notebooks is required, prefer moving logic into Python modules in `src/` and import into notebooks.
